    "ac": 36,
    "bt": 45,
    "complexity": "Complex",
    "description": "All six sides of this adamantine-reinforced box are covered with Thassilonian runes. Touching a rune allows one to exchange its position with another.",
    "disable": "Thievery DC 41 (expert) to feel the subtle vibrations when moving a rune to shift into the right position, or Thassilon Lore DC 33 (expert) or Society DC 38 (master) while being able to read Thassilonian to work out the anagram puzzle using traditional means, or *dispel magic* (7th level; counteract DC 34)",
